- This course explores the basic concepts of natural language processing (NLP) and its applications. Students will learn how to analyze, process, and understand text using various symbolic and statistical methods, while focusing on specific tasks such as text classification, sentiment analysis and information extraction. This program covers both theoretical foundations and practical implementations through projects and real-world case studies

