### **Web** (EN) - 3 ECTS  
- Lecteur: M. Buffa
- It has also become a “social machine” and a technological
infrastructure for collective intelligence, which constitutes an
interesting and complex subject of study.
The objective of this course is to provide a comprehensive introduction
